{"symbol":"PCL","yahoo":"PCL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Prospect Consumer Products Limited","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Farm Products","website":"https://prospectconsumer.com","about":"Prospect Consumer Products Limited processes and trades in cashew nuts and allied products in India and internationally. The company offers cashew nuts and kernels; and cashew by-products, including cashew husks, cashew husk pellets, and cashew nut shells under the DRIFRUTZ brand. It exports its products. The company distributes its products through distributor networks, retail partnerships with supermarket chains, and e-commerce platforms. The company was formerly known as Prospect Commodities Limited and changed its name to Prospect Consumer Products Limited in October 2024. Prospect Consumer Products Limited was founded in 2015 and is based in Ahmedabad, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:08:25+00:00","quote":{"price":31.24,"prevClose":31.24,"marketCap":19.17,"high52":93.0,"low52":29.56,"pe":7.79,"bookValue":52.24,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":8.79,"shares":0.6136,"insiders":66.55,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2023-03-20","2023-03-21","2023-03-22","2023-03-23","2023-03-24","2023-03-27","2023-03-28","2023-03-29","2023-03-31","2023-04-03","2023-04-05","2023-04-06","2023-04-10","2023-04-11","2023-04-12","2023-04-13","2023-04-17","2023-04-18","2023-04-19","2023-04-20","2023-04-21","2023-04-24","2023-04-25","2023-04-26","2023-04-27","2023-04-28","2023-05-02","2023-05-03","2023-05-04","2023-05-05","2023-05-08","2023-05-09","2023-05-10","2023-05-11","2023-05-12","2023-05-15","2023-05-16","2023-05-17","2023-05-18","2023-05-19","2023-05-22","2023-05-23","2023-05-24","2023-05-25","2023-05-26","2023-05-29","2023-05-30","2023-05-31","2023-06-01","2023-06-02","2023-06-05","2023-06-06","2023-06-07","2023-06-08","2023-06-09","2023-06-12","2023-06-13","2023-06-14","2023-06-15","2023-06-16","2023-06-19","2023-06-20","2023-06-21","2023-06-22","2023-06-23","2023-06